      {
        "example_text": "I could perceive a faint light in the distance.",
        "intended_cefr": "B1"
      },
      {
        "example_text": "People often perceive him as cold, but he is actually very kind.",
        "intended_cefr": "B2"
      },
      {
        "example_text": "Experts perceive a major shift in global economic trends.",
        "intended_cefr": "C1"
      }
    ],
    "mnemonic_ar": "تذكر كلمة \"receive\" التي تعني يستقبل، فكلمة \"perceive\" تعني أن تستقبل الإشارات بحواسك لتدرك وتفهم ما حولك.",
